From: Zhiyu722 <Zhiyu722@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 18:04:40 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 50/71] ASoC: aw882xx: Build the ROM's amplifier register
 tables into the image

The amplifier profile has to come from the four tables the ROM ships in
/vendor/firmware - aw882xx_spk_reg_l/r.bin and aw882xx_rcv_reg_l/r.bin, 148
bytes each.  request_firmware() only reaches them through ueventd's /vendor
lookup because this ROM leaves firmware_class.path empty, so
CONFIG_EXTRA_FIRMWARE builds them into the kernel: the loader checks its built
in copy first and the driver always gets the board specific profile, notably
I2SCTRL 0x06 with the left channel bit that the generic default lacks.

The tables live next to the driver because the kernel's .gitignore keeps
/firmware out of the tree.

Signed-off-by: Zhiyu722 <Zhiyu722@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 arch/arm64/configs/h130_factory.config            |   2 +-
 .../codecs/awinic/firmware/aw882xx_rcv_reg_l.bin  | Bin 0 -> 148 bytes
 .../codecs/awinic/firmware/aw882xx_rcv_reg_r.bin  | Bin 0 -> 148 bytes
 .../codecs/awinic/firmware/aw882xx_spk_reg_l.bin  | Bin 0 -> 148 bytes
 .../codecs/awinic/firmware/aw882xx_spk_reg_r.bin  | Bin 0 -> 148 bytes
 5 files changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100755 techpack/audio/asoc/codecs/awinic/firmware/aw882xx_rcv_reg_l.bin
 create mode 100755 techpack/audio/asoc/codecs/awinic/firmware/aw882xx_rcv_reg_r.bin
 create mode 100755 techpack/audio/asoc/codecs/awinic/firmware/aw882xx_spk_reg_l.bin
 create mode 100755 techpack/audio/asoc/codecs/awinic/firmware/aw882xx_spk_reg_r.bin

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/h130_factory.config b/arch/arm64/configs/h130_factory.config
index 92bd38cea..9d80e254d 100755
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/h130_factory.config
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/h130_factory.config
@@ -1300,7 +1300,7 @@ CONFIG_STANDALONE=y
 CONFIG_PREVENT_FIRMWARE_BUILD=y
 CONFIG_FW_LOADER=y
 CONFIG_FIRMWARE_IN_KERNEL=y
-CONFIG_EXTRA_FIRMWARE=""
+CONFIG_EXTRA_FIRMWARE="aw882xx_spk_reg_l.bin aw882xx_spk_reg_r.bin aw882xx_rcv_reg_l.bin aw882xx_rcv_reg_r.bin"
